OL,3,GNEWSAMan tried to rape woman near M1
OL,4,Aservices, jury told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lorry driver attempted to rape a
OL,7,Fwoman he did not know after grabbing
OL,8,Fher on a country lane near a service
OL,9,Fstation on the M1 in Leicestershire, a
OL,10,Fcourt has heard.
OL,12,FA jury at Leicester Crown Court on
OL,13,FMonday was told Tadeusz Podlasinski,
OL,14,F60, approached the woman on Baines
OL,15,FLane, near the Leicester Forest East
OL,16,Fservices, on 25 April and "attempted to
OL,17,Fpush her into nearby bushes".
OL,19,FProsecutor Michael Brady KC said the
OL,20,FPolish national was "persistent" in his
OL,21,Fattempt to rape the woman, who
OL,22,F"repeatedly" told him to stop.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
