OL,5,
OL,6,FPodlasinski, of Nowa Wies Wielka,
OL,7,Fdenies attempted rape, attempted
OL,8,Fassault by penetration, an alternative
OL,9,Fcount of sexual assault and intentional
OL,10,Fstrangulation.
